#: ../../zh/triton_api/Compiler_Hint_Ops/max_constancy.md:5
msgid "`max_constancy` 用于向编译器声明输入张量中值的常量性模式，告知编译器输入数据中每组连续的值都是相等的。"
msgstr ""
"`max_constancy` is used to declare the constancy pattern of values in the "
"input tensor to the compiler, informing the compiler that each group of "
"consecutive values in the input data is equal."

