msgid ""
"**`values`描述着每个维度的恒定性特征，所以`values` 的维度要与`input` 的维度相同。 "
"注意当`shape`的最后一维为`1`时出现的降维情况。**"
msgstr ""
"**`values` describes the constancy characteristics of each dimension, so the"
" dimension of `values` must be the same as the dimension of `input`. Note "
"the dimensionality reduction that occurs when the last dimension of `shape` "
"is `1`.**"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Compiler_Hint_Ops/max_constancy.md:24
